      }
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "recall: labels a flag points at (same place; a label with no place: a flag of its category in the item). item_recall: labelled errors whose item has any flag. precision: flags that point at a label.",
    "false_alarm_rate: clean labelled items (labels: []) with any flag.",
    "Injected variants are scored on what they add over their base; the base's own errors are not labelled.",
    "held_out:<strategy>: tuned on 4 folds, measured on the 5th (folds by source text). `chosen` is the strategy with the better held-out result; tuned_in_sample is it refitted on all labels (optimistic).",
    "support: per signal|category|kind, how many of its candidates pointed at a labelled error (right) of n."
  ]
}
